      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Son of man, prophesy against the shepherds of Israel, prophesy, and say to them, even to the shepherds, Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Ho, shepherds of Israel who have been feeding yourselves! Should not shepherds feed the sheep? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You eat the fat, you clothe yourselves with the wool, you slaughter the fatlings; but you do not feed the sheep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The weak you have not strengthened, the sick you have not healed, the crippled you have not bound up, the strayed you have not brought back, the lost you have not sought, and with force and harshness you have ruled them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 9.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 6.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " So they were scattered, because there was no shepherd; and they became food for all the wild beasts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My sheep were scattered, they wandered over all the mountains and on every high hill; my sheep were scattered over all the face of the earth, with none to search or seek for them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Therefore, you shepherds, hear the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As I live, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", because my sheep have become a prey, and my sheep have become food for all the wild beasts, since there was no shepherd; and because my shepherds have not searched for my sheep, but the shepherds have fed themselves, and have not fed my sheep; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore, you shepherds, hear the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Behold, I am against the shepherds; and I will require my sheep at their hand, and put a stop to their feeding the sheep; no longer shall the shepherds feed themselves. I will rescue my sheep from their mouths, that they may not be food for them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“For thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I, I myself will search for my sheep, and will seek them out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a shepherd seeks out his flock when some of his sheep",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "when he is among his sheep",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " have been scattered abroad, so will I seek out my sheep; and I will rescue them from all places where they have been scattered on a day of clouds and thick darkness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will bring them out from the peoples, and gather them from the countries, and will bring them into their own land; and I will feed them on the mountains of Israel, by the fountains, and in all the inhabited places of the country. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will feed them with good pasture, and upon the mountain heights of Israel shall be their pasture; there they shall lie down in good grazing land, and on fat pasture they shall feed on the mountains of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I myself will be the shepherd of my sheep, and I will make them lie down, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 19.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will seek the lost, and I will bring back the strayed, and I will bind up the crippled, and I will strengthen the weak, and the fat and the strong I will watch over;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "destroy",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will feed them in justice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“As for you, my flock, thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I judge between sheep and sheep, rams and he-goats. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is it not enough for you to feed on the good pasture, that you must tread down with your feet the rest of your pasture; and to drink of clear water, that you must foul the rest with your feet? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And must my sheep eat what you have trodden with your feet, and drink what you have fouled with your feet?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Therefore, thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to them: Behold, I, I myself will judge between the fat sheep and the lean sheep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because you push with side and shoulder, and thrust at all the weak with your horns, till you have scattered them abroad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will save my flock, they shall no longer be a prey; and I will judge between sheep and sheep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.37.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 37.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And I will set up over them one shepherd, my servant David, and he shall feed them: he shall feed them and be their shepherd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", will be their God, and my servant David shall be prince among them; I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will make with them a covenant of peace and banish wild beasts from the land, so that they may dwell securely in the wilderness and sleep in the woods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will make them and the places round about my hill a blessing; and I will send down the showers in their season; they shall be showers of blessing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the trees of the field shall yield their fruit, and the earth shall yield its increase, and they shall be secure in their land; and they shall know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I break the bars of their yoke, and deliver them from the hand of those who enslaved them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall no more be a prey to the nations, nor shall the beasts of the land devour them; they shall dwell securely, and none shall make them afraid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will provide for them prosperous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34.29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Old Latin: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "for renown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " plantations so that they shall no more be consumed with hunger in the land, and no longer suffer the reproach of the nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall know that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God, am with them, and that they, the house of Israel, are my people, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you are my sheep, the sheep of my pasture,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
